      "writtenOn": "2024-09-17T21:46:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this context the enum **is** used to identify the service type; while INCLUDE / CHARACTERISTIC do not make sense. I don\u0027t think there is a point in changing that.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 98,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 98,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "a692ee81db76d06a4b34cd2347d07b9ab9df2c3f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "08fb8998_0f10cf72",
        "filename": "pandora/interfaces/pandora_experimental/gatt.proto",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 98,
      "author": {
        "id": 1885151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-17T21:57:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "INCLUDE is what is being sent when included services are found. There isn\u0027t any kind of secondary service in this case",
      "parentUuid": "4cd22d26_e8f67af6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 98,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 98,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "a692ee81db76d06a4b34cd2347d07b9ab9df2c3f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ee5bed53_e06c8d76",
        "filename": "pandora/interfaces/pandora_experimental/gatt.proto",
