      "writtenOn": "2024-09-17T23:36:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But that\u0027s not correct, since the included service has its own service type.\nAnother thing you will want to be careful of: it is possible to have loops with included services, e.g. A (primary) includes B (secondary) includes C includes B.",
